{"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SKHelperCore\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SKHelperCore\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/skhelpercore\/skhelperconfiguration"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SKHelperConfiguration"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":1,"text":"Notes on The product definition file","anchor":"Notes-on-The-product-definition-file"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The structure of the product definition property file may take one of two alternative formats, as described below."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Format 1","anchor":"Format-1"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All in-app purchase products (consumable, non-consumable and subscription) are listed together under the top-level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Products” key. When using this format all subscriptions must use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.{author}.subscription.{subscription-group-name}.{product-name}"},{"type":"text","text":" naming convention, so that subscription group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names can be determined. Other products do not need to adhere to a naming convention."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Format 2","anchor":"Format-2"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Consumable and non-consumable products are listed together under the top-level “Products” key."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Subscriptions are listed under the top-level “Subscriptions” key."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example 1","anchor":"Example-1"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Products listed together. Subscriptions must use the required naming convention:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-\/\/Apple\/\/DTD PLIST 1.0\/\/EN\" \"http:\/\/www.apple.com\/DTDs\/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">","<plist version=\"1.0\">","<dict>","    <key>Products<\/key>","    <array>","        <string>com.rarcher.nonconsumable.flowers.large<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.nonconsumable.flowers.small<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.consumable.plant.installation<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.subscription.vip.gold<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.subscription.vip.silver<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.subscription.vip.bronze<\/string>","    <\/array>","<\/dict>","<\/plist>"],"syntax":null},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example 2","anchor":"Example-2"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All consumables and non-consumables listed together. Subscriptions listed separately,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with two subscription groups named “vip” and “standard” defined:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-\/\/Apple\/\/DTD PLIST 1.0\/\/EN\" \"http:\/\/www.apple.com\/DTDs\/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">","<plist version=\"1.0\">","<dict>","    <key>Products<\/key>","    <array>","        <string>com.rarcher.nonconsumable.flowers.large<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.nonconsumable.flowers.small<\/string>","        <string>com.rarcher.consumable.plant.installation<\/string>","    <\/array>","    <key>Subscriptions<\/key>","    <array>","        <dict>","            <key>Group<\/key>","            <string>vip<\/string>","            <key>Products<\/key>","            <array>